# Requêtes de l'API JobAI — extension VS Code "REST Client" (humao.rest-client)
# Clique sur "Send Request" au-dessus de chaque bloc.
# Ce fichier est versionné : il se partage et se relit comme du code.

@host = http://localhost:3000
@email = profiles-demo@example.com
@password = motdepasse123

### Inscription — attendu 201
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "name": "Lewis"
}

### Connexion — attendu 200 + token
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Sans jeton — attendu 401
GET {{host}}/profiles/me

### Jeton invalide — attendu 401
GET {{host}}/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer ceci-n-est-pas-un-jeton

### Profil pas encore créé — attendu 404
GET {{host}}/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Création sans jeton valide — attendu 401
POST {{host}}/profiles
Authorization: Bearer ceci-n-est-pas-un-jeton
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "professionalInformation": "x",
  "personalInformation": "x",
  "education": "x"
}

### Modification sans jeton valide — attendu 401
PATCH {{host}}/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer ceci-n-est-pas-un-jeton
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "location": "Lyon"
}

### Modification d un profil pas encore créé — attendu 404
PATCH {{host}}/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "location": "Lyon"
}

### Création — attendu 201
POST {{host}}/profiles
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "professionalInformation": "Développeuse backend, 5 ans d'expérience.",
  "personalInformation": "Disponible immédiatement.",
  "education": "Master informatique.",
  "location": "Paris"
}

### Champ requis vide — attendu 400
POST {{host}}/profiles
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "professionalInformation": "",
  "personalInformation": "x",
  "education": "x"
}

### Un second profil pour le même utilisateur — attendu 409
POST {{host}}/profiles
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "professionalInformation": "x",
  "personalInformation": "x",
  "education": "x"
}

### Lecture du profil créé — attendu 200
GET {{host}}/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Modification partielle — attendu 200
PATCH {{host}}/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "location": "Lyon"
}

### PATCH sans aucun champ — attendu 400
PATCH {{host}}/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
